{"id":"a1c8300f7d21b067","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-omegace.md","title":"omega-c.e. 函数","display":"df-omegace — omega-c.e. 函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-omegace","aliases":["43-df-omegace"],"display":"df-omegace — omega-c.e. 函数","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖","source_locator":"External: Denjoy, Demuth, and Density, §2.2, PDF p.8; https://people.math.wisc.edu/~jsmiller8/Papers/DDD.pdf","verification_status":"external-definition-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-omegace"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-omegace</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omegace — omega-c.e. 函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"External: Denjoy, Demuth, and Density, §2.2, PDF p.8; <a href=\"https://people.math.wisc.edu/~jsmiller8/Papers/DDD.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://people.math.wisc.edu/~jsmiller8/Papers/DDD.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"external-definition-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>；离散可计算函数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathrm{CEFunction}(f)\\iff\\exists g\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^2}\\,\\exists b\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\,[\\mathrm{Computable}(g)\\land\\mathrm{Computable}(b)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\bigl((\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s\\ge s_0\\Rightarrow g(n,s)=f(n)))\\land|\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:g(n,s)\\ne g(n,s+1)\\}|\\le b(n)\\bigr)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\omega\\mathrm{CEFunction}(f)\\iff\\exists g\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^2}\\,\\exists b\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\,[\\mathrm{Computable}(g)\\land\\mathrm{Computable}(b)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\bigl((\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s\\ge s_0\\Rightarrow g(n,s)=f(n)))\\land|\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:g(n,s)\\ne g(n,s+1)\\}|\\le b(n)\\bigr)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>明确 g、b 是全函数，界随输入变化但可计算。此为 Demuth 测试索引近似所需机制，2007草稿未系统引入这一随机性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$；离散可计算函数见 [[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\mathrm{CEFunction}(f)\\iff\\exists g\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^2}\\,\\exists b\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\,[\\mathrm{Computable}(g)\\land\\mathrm{Computable}(b)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\bigl((\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s\\ge s_0\\Rightarrow g(n,s)=f(n)))\\land|\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:g(n,s)\\ne g(n,s+1)\\}|\\le b(n)\\bigr)].","display":true}],"bytes":1243,"backlinks":[{"id":"d5ffc25900e8348f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 为特征函数；见 [[43-df-omegace]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-508","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-omegace]] — omega-c.e. 函数"}],"outgoing":["f357216a7edb035a"]}